ViridianCity_School_4F_Text_Placard::
    .string "4F  CATEGORIES\p"
    .string "How things are sorted, and why the\n"
    .string "edges will not hold still.\p"
    .string "The syllabus is on the desk.$"

ViridianCity_School_4F_Text_Syllabus::
    .string "COURSE SYLLABUS\n"
    .string "4F  CATEGORIES\p"
    .string "TOPICS: MIDDLES, EDGES, FEATURES,\n"
    .string "LEVELS, OTHER.\p"
    .string "All of it is on the board.\n"
    .string "The exam covers the board.\p"
    .string "PASS MARK: 80 out of 100.$"

ViridianCity_School_4F_Text_BoardIntro::
    .string "The board is written up neatly,\n"
    .string "in five parts.$"

ViridianCity_School_4F_Text_Middles::
    .string "MIDDLES\p"
    .string "Most kinds have a middle: the best\n"
    .string "example, the one that comes first.\p"
    .string "Everything else is more or less\n"
    .string "like it.$"

ViridianCity_School_4F_Text_Edges::
    .string "EDGES\p"
    .string "No kind has a clean edge.\p"
    .string "Somewhere there is always a thing\n"
    .string "that is half in.$"

ViridianCity_School_4F_Text_Features::
    .string "FEATURES\p"
    .string "Sorting looks at a handful of\n"
    .string "features.\p"
    .string "Pick the wrong ones, and two very\n"
    .string "different things share a drawer.$"

ViridianCity_School_4F_Text_Levels::
    .string "LEVELS\p"
    .string "The same thing sits in several\n"
    .string "kinds at once, at different heights.\p"
    .string "A thing. A kind of thing.\n"
    .string "A kind of kind.$"

ViridianCity_School_4F_Text_Other::
    .string "OTHER\p"
    .string "Every way of sorting ends up with a\n"
    .string "drawer called OTHER.\p"
    .string "Watch how fast it fills.$"

ViridianCity_School_4F_Text_Teacher::
    .string "CATEGORIES.\p"
    .string "Everything in this room belongs to\n"
    .string "something.\p"
    .string "Some of it belongs to two things.\n"
    .string "That is where the marks are lost.$"

ViridianCity_School_4F_Text_Drawers::
    .string "I have sorted everything I own.\p"
    .string "SOCKS. PENS. THINGS THAT ARE\n"
    .string "SOMETIMES A HAT.\p"
    .string "And OTHER.\p"
    .string "OTHER is most of it.$"

ViridianCity_School_4F_Text_Stool::
    .string "A chair with no back is a stool.\p"
    .string "A stool with a back is a chair.\p"
    .string "What is a stool leaning on a wall?\p"
    .string "I have been asked to stop.$"
